WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.641
Here is how to keep your shop's records on WhatsApp, with TradePal Africa.

00:00:04.641 --> 00:00:06.577
It takes about a minute to learn.

00:00:07.777 --> 00:00:08.317
Step one.

00:00:08.317 --> 00:00:09.637
Say hello on WhatsApp.

00:00:09.637 --> 00:00:14.676
TradePal asks for your shop's name, and works out your country and currency for you.

00:00:16.935 --> 00:00:17.598
Step two.

00:00:17.598 --> 00:00:21.428
Write down what happens, just like texting a friend.

00:00:21.428 --> 00:00:22.090
No forms.

00:00:22.090 --> 00:00:23.416
No app to install.

00:00:27.031 --> 00:00:27.773
Step three.

00:00:27.773 --> 00:00:33.578
At the end of the day, type today, to see your sales, your expenses, and what came in.

00:00:33.578 --> 00:00:35.265
You don't need the slash.

00:00:36.465 --> 00:00:37.597
Selling on credit?

00:00:37.597 --> 00:00:41.056
Type debt, a name, and an amount, to note who owes you.

00:00:41.056 --> 00:00:42.565
Type paid when they pay.

00:00:42.565 --> 00:00:45.710
And type debts to see everyone who still owes you.

00:00:51.431 --> 00:00:52.124
Step four.

00:00:52.124 --> 00:00:53.164
Made a mistake?

00:00:53.164 --> 00:00:56.076
Send undo, and the last entry is reversed.

00:00:56.076 --> 00:00:58.017
Nothing is silently deleted.

00:01:00.839 --> 00:01:03.909
Send help any time to see what else you can do.

00:01:03.909 --> 00:01:07.239
Start free on WhatsApp, at tradepalafrica.com.
